Hi there, folks

We come with an utterly important announcement.

You were expecting the game to launch on March 30, however we are forced to reschedule the release to take place on May 27, to be able to make necessary improvements to the game to ensure that you have a breathtaking gaming experience. Our studio is developing the project without extra funding, so we pour our hopes on your understanding.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38970760/43a22b7be2d5b4bc96c19f4bfd08ac0f0a720f1b.png
The demo version of the game will be terminated. Since the demo no longer represents the actual state of the game, we intend to run a CBT (closed beta testing) session of the final version. Of which we will provide more detail soon.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38970760/cca01fcbdca34cf002b1b55cecfb83fdccba9ec3.png

Here’s a list of new features implemented into the project. Turbo Sloths has changed much compared to what you could see in the demo:

 - Arena mode;
 - Survival mode;
 - Flat-out mode;
 - New tracks;
 - New Turbojunk parts;
 - New Turbojunk preset builds;
 - War bots of various types;
 - New weapons (e.g., grenade launcher, machine gun, etc.); 
 - Destructible vehicles;
 - Destructible on-track obstacles;
 - Sounds and effects.

And much more…


{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38970760/4877253dfe8790ae463e932fe37d6aa8159e63ea.png

Thank you very much for your lasting support, and we are looking forward to seeing you race.
